# Tcl 6.7's own test suite with Tiny Tcl 6.8.1 (make test-suite;
# scripts/run-tcl-suite): the failures expected, as "FILE TEST..." lines,
# "stopped" for a file that does not finish. docs/M2-REPORT.md, section 8.
#
# These files make their fixtures with exec (cat, pwd, mkdir) at the top
# level, and Tiny Tcl has no exec command (docs/M1-REPORT.md, section
# 3.2), so the file stops at its first fixture.
cd stopped
exec stopped
file stopped
glob stopped
info stopped
open stopped
source stopped
# The runner names the file in upper case (INFO.TST); the test expects
# the name it was given in lower case.
info info-13.2
